# Folgezettel sequences (denote-sequence) & daily journal (denote-journal)
Output docs/media/journal-and-sequences.gif
Source docs/media/tapes/common.tape

Hide
Type "export DENOTE_DEMO_DIR=/tmp/denote-demo-seq DEMO_SNACKS=1 DEMO_SCHEME=alphanumeric; clear; nvim -u docs/media/demo/init.lua $DENOTE_DEMO_DIR/20261119T112000==1a--folgezettel-branching-notes__philosophy_zettelkasten.md" Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Show
Sleep 1s

Hide
Ctrl+G
Type@5ms `Cap <leader>nzr browse sequence relatives (1, 1b, 1a1)` Enter
Show
Type " nzr"
Sleep 1.5s
Type@100ms "child"
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 1.5s

Ctrl+O
Sleep 700ms

Hide
Ctrl+G
Type@5ms `Cap <leader>nzc create next child sequence (1a2)` Enter
Show
Type " nzc"
Sleep 600ms
Type "Atomic notes" Enter
Sleep 600ms
Type "zettelkasten" Enter
Sleep 2s

Hide
Ctrl+G
Type@5ms `Cap <leader>nj open or create today's journal` Enter
Show
Type " nj"
Sleep 2.5s

Hide
Ctrl+G
Type@5ms `Cap` Enter
Show
Sleep 800ms
